WEBVTT

00:09.476 --> 00:11.569
Can you return my body to normal?

00:12.679 --> 00:15.546
If that is your wish, Father...

00:18.185 --> 00:19.152
Kazuki.

00:20.187 --> 00:22.621
What is your wish?

00:24.891 --> 00:27.985
To be together with you, Father...

00:53.387 --> 00:54.354
Kamui.

01:00.093 --> 01:02.926
In due time, everything will be over.

01:06.400 --> 01:10.302
Episode 24
Legend

01:35.929 --> 01:37.556
Kamui...

01:40.634 --> 01:42.226
It's over.

01:42.302 --> 01:44.395
Everything according to the dreams.

01:46.973 --> 01:48.736
This is the other future.

01:50.043 --> 01:51.908
You had two futures.

01:52.946 --> 01:56.882
To become the Kamui of the Dragons of Heaven or Earth.

01:56.950 --> 01:58.474
That was the one thing...

01:58.552 --> 02:03.012
...unknown even to Princess Hinoto and I, the dreamseers.

02:03.090 --> 02:06.025
However, no matter which side you chose...

02:06.093 --> 02:09.893
The Dragon of Earth Kamui bests the Dragon of Heaven Kamui...

02:09.963 --> 02:11.760
...and changes the world.

02:12.799 --> 02:16.326
That is the one unchanging future.

02:18.105 --> 02:21.905
Back then, you chose to become a Dragon of Heaven.

02:25.879 --> 02:27.244
It seems you've chosen.

02:28.749 --> 02:32.116
One of the Seven Seals, a Dragon of Heaven's future.

02:32.185 --> 02:33.709
You chose.

02:33.787 --> 02:35.311
What's wrong with you?

02:35.389 --> 02:38.187
If you become a Dragon of Heaven...

02:38.258 --> 02:40.692
...it is destiny I become one of Earth.

02:40.761 --> 02:43.958
W-What are you talking about, Fuma?

02:44.030 --> 02:45.554
Two Divine Swords...

02:45.632 --> 02:47.395
Two futures...

02:47.467 --> 02:49.992
I am your twin star.

02:50.070 --> 02:51.037
Fuma?

02:54.241 --> 02:57.574
I am the other "Kamui"!

02:59.613 --> 03:02.582
You set a difficult destiny upon yourself...

03:02.649 --> 03:05.083
...by choosing to become a Dragon of Heaven.

03:06.186 --> 03:08.450
You lost the ones you love...

03:08.522 --> 03:11.514
You lost the comrades that you believed in...

03:11.591 --> 03:14.424
And each time, your heart was torn apart.

03:15.662 --> 03:17.857
If you had chosen the Dragons of Earth...

03:17.931 --> 03:22.095
...you would have at least not been torn apart by sadness.

03:22.169 --> 03:26.799
But if that was the case, Fuma would have felt this pain, right?

03:28.208 --> 03:29.698
That is correct...

03:29.776 --> 03:32.006
Then I'm happy with what I chose.

03:35.015 --> 03:38.712
If Fuma and I had switched destinies...

03:39.753 --> 03:43.780
...I'm sure he would have tried to bring me back, as well.

03:43.857 --> 03:45.552
You're probably right...

03:53.066 --> 03:55.159
Fuma is calling me.

03:56.903 --> 03:58.768
Except for you...

03:58.839 --> 04:02.240
...the Seven Seals have lost their power as the Barriers.

04:03.477 --> 04:06.537
The Barrier Stones of the Shinjuku high rises...

04:06.613 --> 04:08.945
Sunshine 60...

04:09.015 --> 04:11.882
The Barrier String drawn by the Yamanote line...

04:11.952 --> 04:13.249
Tokyo Station...

04:13.320 --> 04:14.685
The Rainbow Bridge...

04:14.754 --> 04:16.847
The Diet Building...

04:16.923 --> 04:20.450
They are all empty shells in terms of their seals.

04:20.527 --> 04:24.588
That place, the one place left, is the final Barrier...

04:24.664 --> 04:26.689
When that falls...

04:26.766 --> 04:28.324
I know.

04:28.401 --> 04:29.993
But before that...

04:30.070 --> 04:32.163
...I will kill Fuma.

05:04.037 --> 05:07.006
The Kamui of the Dragons of Heaven...

05:07.073 --> 05:08.540
...cannot win.

05:13.947 --> 05:15.107
Kakyou?

05:18.018 --> 05:19.417
Hokuto.

05:19.486 --> 05:22.785
There are still things that we can do.

05:44.411 --> 05:47.278
Yuzuriha, someone is here to see you...

05:52.452 --> 05:53.783
Arashi...

05:57.123 --> 05:58.385
I'm sorry...

05:59.526 --> 06:01.391
...for hurting someone you care deeply about.

06:03.029 --> 06:06.795
No, I understand how you feel, Arashi.

06:08.034 --> 06:10.525
The chairman told me a few moments ago...

06:10.604 --> 06:13.129
...that Sorata had passed away.

06:15.175 --> 06:19.544
You wanted to protect Sorata, someone you really cared about.

06:22.315 --> 06:25.250
I'm sure Kusanagi will understand.

06:26.252 --> 06:27.844
The toughest thing...

06:27.921 --> 06:30.913
...is not being able to protect the person you care for.

06:32.258 --> 06:33.486
Yuzuriha...

06:34.527 --> 06:36.995
I wanted to change destiny...

06:37.063 --> 06:39.691
...but I couldn't change anything.

06:39.766 --> 06:41.028
Not one thing...

06:41.101 --> 06:42.591
Arashi...

06:42.669 --> 06:46.036
Perhaps we cannot change destiny.

06:47.440 --> 06:51.433
But there is still someone out there who is trying to fight.

06:52.646 --> 06:57.174
We have all lost our powers as Dragons of Heaven now...

06:58.718 --> 07:01.551
...but we can still wish for something.

07:01.621 --> 07:03.612
What should I wish for?

07:03.690 --> 07:06.488
I no longer have anything...

07:06.559 --> 07:08.754
What Sorata had been wishing for.

07:10.530 --> 07:13.055
I believe Sorata wanted to protect you...

07:13.133 --> 07:16.102
...and this world that you live in.

07:17.137 --> 07:21.005
Karen and Daisuke had made their wishes in a similar manner.

07:21.074 --> 07:22.541
That's what I think.

07:26.513 --> 07:27.844
Arashi...

07:27.914 --> 07:30.815
Everything is now on Kamui's shoulders.

07:30.884 --> 07:33.819
Let's believe in him and make our wishes.

07:40.627 --> 07:41.753
Subaru...

07:45.999 --> 07:47.125
Subaru!

07:59.679 --> 08:02.011
I had someone bring me here...

08:03.049 --> 08:05.244
...because I wanted to talk to you.

08:08.354 --> 08:12.814
What I did to Sei hurt you even more than if I hadn't done it...

08:14.527 --> 08:17.724
And I did it for both your sakes...

08:17.797 --> 08:19.765
My wish didn't come true.

08:22.736 --> 08:25.170
It's really tough, isn't it?

08:25.238 --> 08:26.535
But...

08:26.606 --> 08:29.871
But you can't stay like this forever.

08:29.943 --> 08:34.937
Both Sei and I are no longer living in your world...

08:35.014 --> 08:38.108
...but we're both inside your heart, Subaru.

08:38.184 --> 08:39.173
Remember.

08:40.220 --> 08:43.087
There still must be something you want to protect!

08:44.324 --> 08:45.723
Think back!

08:45.792 --> 08:46.759
Subaru!

08:48.461 --> 08:49.587
What did you do?

08:51.731 --> 08:54.825
You, a dreamseer, hoped for another future?

08:57.337 --> 08:59.134
I'll keep you alive for now.

09:03.409 --> 09:08.039
Because I have to show you the future that you don't desire.

09:28.635 --> 09:30.728
What a wretched world.

09:36.776 --> 09:37.868
Fuma...

09:38.912 --> 09:42.643
The Earth is wishing for a change.

09:42.715 --> 09:46.310
You are the only one getting in its way.

09:47.887 --> 09:50.355
It's useless to fight against destiny.

10:14.280 --> 10:15.269
Kamui!

10:49.315 --> 10:50.748
Fuma...

10:50.817 --> 10:51.784
I...

10:53.253 --> 10:54.220
I...

10:55.121 --> 10:56.748
...will defeat you!

11:16.042 --> 11:17.270
Impossible...

11:20.780 --> 11:22.111
This can't be...

11:31.691 --> 11:33.090
Kamui.

11:33.159 --> 11:36.151
As long as you challenged me to battle...

11:36.229 --> 11:40.325
...you were never fated to awaken as the true Dragon of Heaven...

11:40.400 --> 11:42.391
...and you were destined to die.

11:43.436 --> 11:46.769
A Dragon of Heaven that points his Divine Sword...

11:46.839 --> 11:50.206
...at the one he needs to protect can never unleash its power.

11:50.276 --> 11:52.710
When you tried to defeat me...

11:52.779 --> 11:55.714
...you had already chosen defeat for yourself.

11:58.851 --> 12:02.480
Kamui, there is no way for you to win against me.

12:03.523 --> 12:05.991
This is the one and only future.

12:27.981 --> 12:30.643
All the seals have been broken.

12:36.956 --> 12:38.321
Fuma...

12:43.730 --> 12:45.197
This is...

12:45.264 --> 12:46.754
...what the Earth...

12:46.833 --> 12:47.822
...wishes!

13:02.382 --> 13:03.349
Subaru!

13:08.354 --> 13:09.480
Subaru...

13:13.226 --> 13:17.162
Looks like the Dragon of Earth dreamseer went out of his way...

13:18.197 --> 13:20.256
But it's a matter of time.

13:21.300 --> 13:22.790
When the Barrier is gone...

13:22.869 --> 13:26.032
...the destruction of the world will become reality.

13:28.274 --> 13:29.764
Subaru...

13:29.842 --> 13:31.036
Why?

13:32.278 --> 13:34.371
Your power.

13:35.415 --> 13:38.976
The power you wish for brought me here.

13:40.019 --> 13:42.783
But this is all I can do for you.

13:43.923 --> 13:45.515
This isn't my power...

13:45.591 --> 13:48.754
There's no way for me to hold it back.

13:48.828 --> 13:51.160
You are the one that can do the rest...

13:51.230 --> 13:53.528
But I no longer have...

13:55.068 --> 13:56.558
Kamui...

13:56.636 --> 13:59.298
I dove into your consciousness...

13:59.372 --> 14:03.502
...in an attempt to bring you back to reality, remember?

14:03.576 --> 14:06.340
You later came back of your own will.

14:06.412 --> 14:09.074
Do you regret doing so now?

14:11.050 --> 14:13.018
Of course I don't regret it.

14:14.053 --> 14:15.680
I see.

14:15.755 --> 14:17.416
Then that's enough.

14:18.658 --> 14:22.424
All you need to do is go though to the end with your wish...

14:23.362 --> 14:24.488
That's...

14:25.865 --> 14:27.389
...all.

14:27.467 --> 14:28.661
Subaru!

14:34.640 --> 14:35.664
The Barrier...

14:36.609 --> 14:38.270
Nothing has changed.

14:39.712 --> 14:42.078
In the end, there is only...

14:42.148 --> 14:43.445
...one future.

14:53.726 --> 14:55.785
It's the end, Kamui.

14:56.829 --> 14:58.524
My...

14:58.598 --> 14:59.997
...wish.

15:00.066 --> 15:02.728
I believe in you.

15:02.802 --> 15:06.898
That you'll become strong and not let anything beat you.

15:08.774 --> 15:10.639
Become stronger.

15:10.710 --> 15:13.679
So that you can protect your loved ones.

15:16.215 --> 15:20.709
But still, I want to believe in you...

15:23.456 --> 15:25.981
Kamui, you've regretted enough, right?

15:26.058 --> 15:30.154
Then look forward and take even one step further than now!

15:35.835 --> 15:39.327
The future still hasn't been determined, right?

15:42.241 --> 15:43.765
The Dragons of Heaven...

15:43.843 --> 15:45.333
...have perished!

15:56.923 --> 15:58.049
Fuma...

15:59.458 --> 16:02.018
I finally know...

16:03.429 --> 16:05.363
...how I can bring you back.

16:09.869 --> 16:12.667
I am the Kamui of the Dragons of Earth.

16:13.706 --> 16:14.832
That's fine.

16:15.908 --> 16:17.239
I...

16:17.310 --> 16:21.713
...wanted to protect you and this world that you live in.

16:22.748 --> 16:25.740
But all you can do is die and disappear.

16:25.818 --> 16:27.786
And the world will see a revolution.

16:32.658 --> 16:34.319
I won't disappear.

16:35.361 --> 16:39.092
Because I'll remain in your heart forever.

16:41.300 --> 16:43.700
I finally realized this.

16:43.769 --> 16:45.634
Kotori lives within me.

16:46.672 --> 16:48.469
Mother, too...

16:48.541 --> 16:50.168
Even Sorata...

16:50.243 --> 16:52.803
I'm sure he'll live on in Arashi's heart.

16:54.146 --> 16:57.707
Hinoto, Saiki, and Karen too...

16:57.783 --> 17:00.775
Everyone lives on in another's heart...

17:00.853 --> 17:04.550
Entrusting their wishes to others who are still alive...

17:05.825 --> 17:07.292
So I...

17:07.360 --> 17:09.225
...will entrust my wish...

17:09.295 --> 17:10.819
...to you.

17:12.298 --> 17:15.734
This is the future that I've chosen.

17:43.896 --> 17:45.989
This is Kamui's Barrier.

17:46.065 --> 17:47.032
Kamui!

17:49.101 --> 17:52.468
Kamui protected us...

17:52.538 --> 17:54.005
The entire world.

17:57.943 --> 17:58.910
Inuki!

18:57.770 --> 19:00.830
I hope the girl I fall for is beautiful!
- Sorata

19:05.911 --> 19:09.574
The Final Battle has come to an end.

19:11.450 --> 19:14.385
In a way that was different from my dreams.

19:15.755 --> 19:19.555
People burdened with destiny, each with their own wishes...

19:19.625 --> 19:21.957
...perished without the public knowing.

19:25.231 --> 19:30.635
But their wishes remain alive in the hearts of those left behind.

19:31.670 --> 19:34.662
And the legend continues to be handed down.

19:35.708 --> 19:38.438
The future was not one and absolute.

19:39.478 --> 19:41.173
And from now on...

19:41.247 --> 19:45.047
...there will be as many futures as there are wishes.

20:02.568 --> 20:04.058
Kakyou!

20:04.136 --> 20:06.331
This time, let's go for sure.

20:06.405 --> 20:07.372
Outside.

20:48.681 --> 20:52.640
The future still hasn't been determined, right?
